  "idea": "Cyberchef: the swiss army knife for data conversion and formatting",
  "text": "How to strip HTML, parse JSON, and decrypt strings without installing software. Web scraping and API responses frequently arrive trapped inside raw markup, nested brackets, and encoded symbols. Manually cleaning this text across multiple editors wastes precious hours and introduces costly formatting errors. CyberChef lets you combine drag-and-drop recipes that strip HTML tags, format JSON, and decode strings instantly. You sanitize messy feeds in seconds.",
